---
name: slider
type: registry:ui
title: Slider
description: An input where the user selects a value from within a given range.
dependencies:
  - bits-ui
files:
  - path: registry/items/components/slider/slider.svelte
    type: registry:ui
    target: "~/components/slider/slider.svelte"
  - path: registry/items/components/slider/index.ts
    type: registry:ui
    target: "~/components/slider/index.ts"
---

Use slider for continuous or stepped range selection. Set `type="single"` and bind `value`. Pass
`max`, `step`, and optionally `orientation="vertical"`.

```svelte
<script lang="ts">
	import { Slider } from '~/components/slider';

	let value = $state(33);
</script>

<Slider type="single" bind:value max={100} step={1} />
```
